  "description": "Explicit geodesic Leech labelings of the wheels W_5,...,W_13, as printed in Table 1 of the companion paper. W_n is the wheel on n vertices in total: a hub joined to a cycle of length m = n-1. spokes[i] labels the edge from the hub to rim vertex v_i; rims[i] labels the rim edge v_i v_{i+1}, indices mod m. Both lists are in cyclic order along the rim. t_gp = m(m+3)/2 is the geodesic path number of W_n. The rows W_5 and W_6 are the labelings of Lakshmanan and Manattu (arXiv:2502.16628, Figure 3); W_7,...,W_13 are new to the companion paper.",
